@startuml
title Utilisation d'un Agent (1/2) - Achat et Acces

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam sequenceDividerFontSize 10

autonumber

actor       "Acheteur"        as Buyer
participant "Frontend"        as Client
participant "MetaMask"        as MM      #Orange
participant "Backend"         as API
database    "PostgreSQL"      as DB
participant "IdentityRegistry" as IR     #LightBlue
participant "EscrowManager"   as Escrow  #LightBlue

== Consultation ==

Buyer   ->  Client : consulterAgent(agentId)
activate Client

Client  ->  API    : obtenirInfoAchat(agentId)
activate API

API     ->  IR     : lirePrixParTache(agentId)
activate IR
IR     -->  API    : prixETH
deactivate IR

API    -->  Client : infoAchat(taskId, prixETH, donneesTransaction)
deactivate API

Client -->  Buyer  : afficherPrix(prixETH)
deactivate Client

== Paiement on-chain ==

Buyer   ->  Client : confirmerAchat()
activate Client

Client  ->  MM     : signerEtEnvoyer(txDepotPaiement)
activate MM

MM     ->>  Buyer  : demanderApprobation()
Buyer  -->  MM     : approuve

MM      ->  Escrow : deposerPaiement(taskId, agentId)
activate Escrow
Escrow  ->  Escrow : emit PaymentDeposited(taskId, buyer, amount)
activate Escrow
deactivate Escrow
Escrow  -->  MM     : txHash
deactivate Escrow

MM     -->  Client : hashTransaction

note over Escrow : The Graph lit les logs\nde la blockchain (async)\net indexe PaymentDeposited
deactivate MM

== Octroi d'acces ==

Client  ->  API    : acquerirAcces(agentId, taskId, wallet)
activate API

API     ->  Escrow : verifierPaiement(taskId)
activate Escrow
Escrow  -->  API    : paiementConfirme
deactivate Escrow

API     ->  DB     : enregistrerAcces(agentId, taskId)
activate DB
DB     -->  API    : ok
deactivate DB

API    -->  Client : accesAccorde(idAcces)
deactivate API

Client -->  Buyer  : afficherAccesAgent()
deactivate Client

@enduml
